WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.380
Hi, I'm Tilly! Now your ssh agent can follow you.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.300
This pane uses the agent of the laptop you attached from.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:12.730
Attach from your desktop, and the same pane gets the desktop's key.

00:00:15.332 --> 00:00:18.372
Type on the laptop again, and its agent comes back.

00:00:20.262 --> 00:00:22.902
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
